          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"pricing.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Investment Options</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Investment and program tiers for lasting habit change with {{COACH_NAME}} {{CREDENTIALS}}\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0b0b0c;--muted:#9aa3ad;--accent:#ffd166;--card:#111213;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--white:#fff}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; color:var(--white);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#050505 0%, #0d0d0e 100%)}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:36px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.6px;margin:0}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:32px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:40px}\\n    .hero h2{font-size:38px;line-height:1.03;margin:0;color:var(--white)}\\n    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px}\\n    .hero img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);padding:18px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:28px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:22px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .card h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .price{font-size:28px;color:var(--accent);margin:8px 0}\\n    .list{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 18px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#121212;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .meta{margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);margin-top:44px;padding-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .mini-test{margin-top:28px;background:var(--glass);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:28px}\\n    .faq h4{margin:14px 0 6px 0}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd166, #ff8a66);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#111\\\">WC</div>\\n        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Praise</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h2 id=\\\"pricing-hero\\\">Choose how you'd like to change — clear plans that meet you where you are.</h2>\\n        <p>Practical coaching backed by a behavior-first framework. Small shifts, measurable momentum. Pick the rhythm and support level that fits your life.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a style=\\\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Questions? Email {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Sessions run virtually from {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Payment plans available. No medical advice — coaching focused on habits and sustainable routines.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"illustration\\\" />\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"investments\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"investments\\\" style=\\\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:8px\\\">Investment pathways</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Different levels of support to match energy and time. Each pathway centers on the ALIGN → ACT → ADAPT process to build habits that stick.</p>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" role=\\\"list\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Starter Habit Plan</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$297 one-time</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"list\\\">4-week guided plan • 1 launch call • habit checklist • email support</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Start with a Discovery Call</a>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Best for: people rebooting routines with limited time.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Momentum Coaching</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$650 / month</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"list\\\">Weekly 45-min sessions • tailored habit plan • asynchronous check-ins • progress reviews</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Apply</a>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Best for: building consistent systems over 3–6 months.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Deep Roots — Transformative Path</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$3,600 / 3 months</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"list\\\">Twice-monthly 60-min sessions • deep habit architecture • priority messaging • bespoke toolkit</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Inquire</a>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Best for: lasting identity-level change and leadership of daily rituals.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:22px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:10px\\\">\\n        <strong>Pay-as-you-go options:</strong> Single sessions available at $150/60min. Workshops and corporate sessions priced per request.\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:30px\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"why-invest\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"why-invest\\\" style=\\\"font-size:18px\\\">How I frame investment</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">You’re not just buying sessions — you’re buying a structured practice. I design each plan around three outcomes: clarity (set the goal), micro-practices (small daily wins), and compounding review (adjust and embed). That’s how progress becomes habit.</p>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mini-test\\\">\\n        <strong>Lead magnet:</strong> Download the free Habit Start Kit at <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a> — a short workbook that pairs with any program.\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Common questions about cost & commitment</h3>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Do you offer payment plans?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Yes. For the Deep Roots package we offer split payments — request details when you apply.</p>\\n        <h4>What if I need to pause coaching?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We add pauses when needed; longer-term packages retain your framework and checkpoints so you can pick up quickly.</p>\\n        <h4>Is there a satisfaction policy?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">If a session does not meet expectations, let us know within 48 hours; we'll arrange a make-up or credit toward future work.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"testimonials.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Stories — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Client stories and results from coaching with {{COACH_NAME}}\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--ink:#0b0b0d;--muted:#525961;--accent:#0077ff;--card:#f6f8fb}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 22px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .logo{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:26px}\\n    .lead img{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef3ff;padding:10px}\\n    .lead h1{font-size:30px;margin:0}\\n    .quote{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eef6ff,#ffffff);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,119,255,0.06)}\\n    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .card p{margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .faq{margin-top:22px}\\n    @media (max-width:820px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lead{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.lead img{width:120px;height:120px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"lead\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"avatar illustration\\\" />\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Real change. Real people.</h1>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Short stories from clients who shifted habits, reclaimed time, and built practices that feel sustainable. No miracles — just repeatable design.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Get the Habit Start Kit</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section aria-labelledby=\\\"voices\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"voices\\\" style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px\\\">Client spotlight</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"cards\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"I finally have mornings I can rely on.\\\"</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">— Maya, product manager • completed the Refresh Sprint</p>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">After two months of focused adjustments, Maya moved from chaotic mornings to a 30-minute ritual that sets her up for the day. She attributes the change to micro-practices and weekly accountability.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"Workouts stuck — and so did my energy.\\\"</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">— Daniel, teacher • finished Steady Coaching</p>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Daniel rebuilt his routine by pairing short strength sessions with sleep anchors. The approach favored small wins over big resolutions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"I stopped relying on willpower.\\\"</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">— Priya, entrepreneur • Thrive Path alumni</p>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Through habit architecture she created default actions that removed decision fatigue. Three months later, behaviors feel automatic.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"I learned to pace change.\\\"</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">— Marcus, freelancer • one-off sessions</p>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Marcus used a single intensive session to map a 6-week plan and then executed it independently. He appreciated the clarity and a simple review habit.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"what-to-expect\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"what-to-expect\\\" style=\\\"font-size:18px\\\">What people tell me matters most</h2>\\n      <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <li>Simple, repeated practices beat sporadic intensity.</li>\\n        <li>Accountability feels easier when it's structured and predictable.</li>\\n        <li>Small adjustments compound into real life changes.</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq2\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq2\\\">Questions I often hear</h3>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>How quickly will I see progress?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Many clients report momentum in 2–4 weeks. Deeper identity shifts take longer; that's why we design multi-month pathways.</p>\\n        <h4>Do you work with groups?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Yes — I run small cohort workshops and team sessions. Reach out with details about your group.</p>\\n        <h4>Can I try a single session?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Absolutely. Single sessions are great for kickstarts and revisions to existing plans.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\">\\n      <h3>Want to share your story?</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">If you've worked together and want to be featured, email a short note to <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> — I love hearing progress updates.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a quick story call</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n      <div>&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reserve a discovery call or session with {{COACH_NAME}}. Choose a pathway and schedule time to begin.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f9fafb;--ink:#0f1724;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#1f8cff;--panel:#ffffff}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:26px}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(31,140,255,0.06), rgba(31,140,255,0.02));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .hero img{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0;font-size:22px}\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px;margin-top:22px}\\n    form{background:var(--panel);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid #e6edf3;border-radius:8px;box-sizing:border-box}\\n    .submit{margin-top:14px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;border:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .side{background:var(--panel);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:#eef2ff;color:#0a3ea6;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px}\\n    .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:10px}\\n    @media (max-width:880px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}.hero img{width:88px;height:88px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">The Journey</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book A Session</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach Out</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"pattern illustration\\\" />\\n      <div>\\n        <h2>Reserve your spot — discovery calls & session booking</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Start with a 20-minute discovery call to explore fit, or book a single session to work on an immediate challenge. Packages available after that.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" aria-label=\\\"Booking form\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Book a Discovery Call</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Choose a time and tell me what you want to prioritize. I will follow up to confirm and share next steps.</p>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"type\\\">Session type</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n          <option>20-minute Discovery Call — free</option>\\n          <option>60-minute Single Session — $150</option>\\n          <option>90-minute Deep Session — $220</option>\\n        </select>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"goals\\\">What are you hoping to change?</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"goals\\\" name=\\\"goals\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Brief goals or obstacles\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"times\\\">Preferred days/times</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"times\\\" name=\\\"times\\\" placeholder=\\\"Weekday mornings, evenings, specific dates\\\" />\\n\\n        <button class=\\\"submit\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request booking</button>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"note\\\">By submitting you agree I may reach out via email to confirm scheduling. Cancellation policy: please give 24 hours notice to reschedule.</div>\\n      </form>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"side\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Quick options</div>\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">If you're unsure</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Pick the Discovery Call. We'll outline a 6–12 week plan together and choose a package that fits your tempo and budget.</p>\\n\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Sample programs</h4>\\n        <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li><strong>Discovery Call</strong> — align on goals</li>\\n          <li><strong>90-Day Pathways</strong> — structured weekly coaching</li>\\n          <li><strong>Monthly Momentum</strong> — check-in & refinement</li>\\n        </ul>\\n\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Need invoicing?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> with your billing details and we will send an invoice.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Location</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Virtual sessions based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Plans available globally while respecting time zones.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Contact</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">{{PHONE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h4 style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">What to expect in a Discovery Call</h4>\\n      <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <li>We clarify one or two immediate priorities.</li>\\n        <li>I sketch an approach with micro-practices you can start tomorrow.</li>\\n        <li>If helpful, we'll map a multi-session pathway and next steps.</li>\\n      </ol>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n      <div>&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
  "parallel_tool_calls": true,
  "presence_penalty": 0,
